      "writtenOn": "2022-01-13T03:14:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is only one service will handle this action, and it\u0027s decided by the declared sequence in AndroidManifest.xml.\n\nFor example, if the AndroidManifest.xml is something like below, then \"MyService2\" will handle this action.\n\n```\n\u003cservice\n    android:name\u003d\".MyService2\"\n    android:enabled\u003d\"true\"\n    android:exported\u003d\"true\"\u003e\n    \u003cintent-filter\u003e\n        \u003caction android:name\u003d\"android.net.action.VPN_MANAGER_ERROR\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_USER_DEACTIVATED\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_IKE\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_NETWORK\" /\u003e\n    \u003c/intent-filter\u003e\n\u003c/service\u003e\n\n\u003cservice\n    android:name\u003d\".MyService\"\n    android:enabled\u003d\"true\"\n    android:exported\u003d\"true\"\u003e\n    \u003cintent-filter\u003e\n        \u003caction android:name\u003d\"android.net.action.VPN_MANAGER_ERROR\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_USER_DEACTIVATED\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_IKE\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_NETWORK\" /\u003e\n    \u003c/intent-filter\u003e\n\u003c/service\u003e\n```\n\n... and if the AndroidManifest.xml is something like below, then \"MyService\" will handle this action.\n\n```\n\u003cservice\n    android:name\u003d\".MyService\"\n    android:enabled\u003d\"true\"\n    android:exported\u003d\"true\"\u003e\n    \u003cintent-filter\u003e\n        \u003caction android:name\u003d\"android.net.action.VPN_MANAGER_ERROR\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_USER_DEACTIVATED\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_IKE\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_NETWORK\" /\u003e\n    \u003c/intent-filter\u003e\n\u003c/service\u003e\n\n\u003cservice\n    android:name\u003d\".MyService2\"\n    android:enabled\u003d\"true\"\n    android:exported\u003d\"true\"\u003e\n    \u003cintent-filter\u003e\n        \u003caction android:name\u003d\"android.net.action.VPN_MANAGER_ERROR\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_USER_DEACTIVATED\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_IKE\" /\u003e\n        \u003ccategory android:name\u003d\"android.net.category.ERROR_NETWORK\" /\u003e\n    \u003c/intent-filter\u003e\n\u003c/service\u003e\n```",
